ok 47 - lineage: physical rows stay active/revoked; the sequence is 1, 2, 3 with no gap [P2-S11-AC-115]
ok 48 - lineage: a prior row is never updated, supersession is derived [P2-S11-AC-114]
ok 49 - lineage: a prior row is never deleted [P2-S11-AC-114]
